{:edb/db-before-t 1230 :edb/db-after-t 1231 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534543 50 #inst "2026-10-07T21:50:48.531Z" 13194139534543 true] [17592186096754 1020 #edb/ref 17592186293935 13194139534543 true] [17592186096754 1020 #edb/ref 17592186293942 13194139534543 true] [17592186096755 1020 #edb/ref 17592186293925 13194139534543 true] [17592186096755 1020 #edb/ref 17592186293932 13194139534543 true] [17592186096755 1020 #edb/ref 17592186293949 13194139534543 true] [17592186293925 1017 #edb/ref 17592186293926 13194139534543 true] [17592186293925 1089 "q-114592" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293925 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534543 true] [17592186293925 1100 "$\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293925 1113 #uuid "6b86c6e4-2e5b-5fd5-acdb-a0e53fdeb34a" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293925 1145 "First, we write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)\\,\\text{d}x=\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)\\cdot 1\\cdot \\text{d}x.\n$$\n\n \n\nWe will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x-3} \\\\ {v}^{′}=1\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\,\\text{d}x=x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u\\,{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)\\cdot x-\\int x\\cdot \\frac{1}{x-3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-\\int \\frac{x}{x-3}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use a substitution $x-3=u,$ thus $x=u+3$ and $\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.$ Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-\\int \\frac{x}{x-3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-\\int \\frac{u+3}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-\\int \\,\\text{d}u-3\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{u} \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-u-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡u+D \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-(x-3)-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)+D \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-x+3+D \\\\  & =(x-3)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-x+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=D+3$ is an integral constant." 13194139534543 true] [17592186293926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293927 13194139534543 true] [17592186293926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293928 13194139534543 true] [17592186293926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293929 13194139534543 true] [17592186293926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293930 13194139534543 true] [17592186293926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293931 13194139534543 true] [17592186293926 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534543 true] [17592186293926 1041 "selection" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293926 1104 #edb/ref 17592186293929 13194139534543 true] [17592186293926 1110 #uuid "0f253d85-c210-5565-afd9-b86eecd88011" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293927 1034 "(2x-1)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-x+C" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293927 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534543 true] [17592186293927 1111 #uuid "6a9e84e4-0159-5c35-ab56-b2fb3eef105d" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293928 1034 "(x-3)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-6x+C" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293928 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534543 true] [17592186293928 1111 #uuid "f6a9a4b2-94cf-5cea-8601-fae741bfc553" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293929 1034 "(x-3)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)-x+C" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293929 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534543 true] [17592186293929 1111 #uuid "e160f72d-d70e-563e-b0e2-4f69c703004d" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293930 1034 "(2x-1)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)+C" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293930 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534543 true] [17592186293930 1111 #uuid "85934a88-847c-5579-b52f-c98987135b92" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293931 1034 "(x-3)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x-3)+3x+C" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293931 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534543 true] [17592186293931 1111 #uuid "e48d527f-2067-50f2-be69-8c868207bf16" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293932 1017 #edb/ref 17592186293933 13194139534543 true] [17592186293932 1089 "q-351016" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293932 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139534543 true] [17592186293932 1100 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8}{log}_{3}⁡(8x)\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293932 1113 #uuid "60e017ef-1df5-5087-bcd7-4d4b713d9cc6" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293932 1145 "First, we write the integral as\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8}{log}_{3}⁡(8x)\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8}{log}_{3}⁡(8x)\\cdot 1\\cdot \\text{d}x.\n$$\n\n \n\nWe will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={log}_{3}⁡(8x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)} \\\\ {v}^{′}=1\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int 1\\cdot \\,dx=x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8}{log}_{3}⁡(8x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8}u{v}^{′}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv{|}_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8}-{\\int }_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8}v{u}^{′}\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={log}_{3}⁡(8x)\\,(x){|}_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8}-{\\int }_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8}x(\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =[{log}_{3}⁡(8\\cdot \\frac{{e}^{3}}{8})\\,(\\frac{{e}^{3}}{8})-{log}_{3}⁡(8\\cdot \\frac{1}{8})\\,(\\frac{1}{8})]-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)}{\\int }_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{3}}{8}{log}_{3}⁡({e}^{3})-\\frac{1}{8}{log}_{3}⁡(1)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)}x{|}_{1/8}^{{e}^{3}/8} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{3}}{8}\\cdot \\frac{3}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)}-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)}(\\frac{{e}^{3}}{8}-\\frac{1}{8}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3)}(2{e}^{3}+1).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293933 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293934 13194139534543 true] [17592186293933 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534543 true] [17592186293933 1041 "field-1" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293933 1104 #edb/ref 17592186293934 13194139534543 true] [17592186293933 1110 #uuid "5bbe9ae0-c8e2-5837-bd7c-0b50582d2798" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293934 1034 "\\frac{2e^3+1}{8\\ln(3)}" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293934 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534543 true] [17592186293934 1111 #uuid "9662af08-d7c1-5e9d-9406-c9a29a091296" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293935 1017 #edb/ref 17592186293936 13194139534543 true] [17592186293935 1089 "q-78961" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293935 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534543 true] [17592186293935 1100 "Calculate $\\int 16{x}^{3}{log}_{3}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293935 1113 #uuid "ee7df271-efad-5656-8b8b-3993fc52b08a" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293935 1145 "We will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={log}_{3}⁡(x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3} \\\\ {v}^{′}=16{x}^{3}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int 16{x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x=4{x}^{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 16{x}^{3}{log}_{3}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={log}_{3}⁡(x)(4{x}^{4})-\\int \\frac{4{x}^{4}}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{x}^{4}{log}_{3}⁡(x)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\int 4{x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{x}^{4}{log}_{3}⁡(x)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\cdot {x}^{4}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{4{x}^{4}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-\\frac{{x}^{4}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{4}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(4\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant.\n\nNote that in the above calculation we used the change of base formula ${log}_{3}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}.$" 13194139534543 tr