089 "q-78962" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293942 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534543 true] [17592186293942 1100 "Calculate $\\int 25{x}^{4}{log}_{2}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293942 1113 #uuid "0002bb48-63e3-5869-82b8-396b34ff4061" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293942 1145 "We will solve this problem using integration by parts. We start by defining $u$ and ${v}^{′},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u={log}_{2}⁡(x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡2} \\\\ {v}^{′}=25{x}^{4}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int 25{x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x=5{x}^{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 25{x}^{4}{log}_{2}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={log}_{2}⁡(x)(5{x}^{5})-\\int \\frac{5{x}^{5}}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5{x}^{5}{log}_{2}⁡(x)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\int 5{x}^{4}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =5{x}^{5}{log}_{2}⁡(x)-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}\\cdot {x}^{5}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{5{x}^{5}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}-\\frac{{x}^{5}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{5}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}(5\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-1)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant.\n\nNote that in the above calculation we used the change of base formula ${log}_{2}⁡x=\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}.$" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293943 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293944 13194139534543 true] [17592186293943 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293945 13194139534543 true] [17592186293943 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293946 13194139534543 true] [17592186293943 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293947 13194139534543 true] [17592186293943 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293948 13194139534543 true] [17592186293943 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534543 true] [17592186293943 1041 "selection" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293943 1104 #edb/ref 17592186293948 13194139534543 true] [17592186293943 1110 #uuid "1e49af5d-d2