\\begin{aligned}u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4x)\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=\\frac{1}{x} \\\\ {v}^{′}=1\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\int \\,\\text{d}x=x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula of integration by parts, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\int \\operatorname{ln}⁡(4x)\\,\\text{d}x & =2\\int u\\,{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2[uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =2[\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4x)\\cdot x-\\int x\\cdot \\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =2[x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4x)-\\int \\,\\text{d}x] \\\\  & =2x\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4x)-2x+C \\\\  & =2x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4x)-1)+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an integral constant." 13194139534543 true] [17592186293950 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293951 13194139534543 true] [17592186293950 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293952 13194139534543 true] [17592186293950 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293953 13194139534543 true] [17592186293950 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293954 13194139534543 true] [17592186293950 1000 #edb/ref 17592186293955 13194139534543 true] [17592186293950 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534543 true] [17592186293950 1041 "selection" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293950 1104 #edb/ref 17592186293953 13194139534543 true] [17592186293950 1110 #uuid "69fc184d-93d8-5619-91bc-9ecb7ce71f48" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293951 1034 "2x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)+1)+C" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293951 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534543 true] [17592186293951 1111 #uuid "d8803e90-c191-52d6-8000-b1786a6f2b98" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293952 1034 "4x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4x)+1)+C" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293952 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534543 true] [17592186293952 1111 #uuid "c33681d6-952b-5538-8d83-59c7b03cbb1f" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293953 1034 "2x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4x)-1)+C" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293953 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534543 true] [17592186293953 1111 #uuid "93bad77f-fc4c-5151-b61a-1e3552e61d95" 13194139534543 true] [17592186293954 1034 "4x(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2x)-1)+C" 13194139534543 tru